.env
.env.*
.env.bak-*
venv*
ekko_trips_venv/
sorted_summer_days.json
EKKO_Trips.csv
__pycache__/
photo_uploads/
# Legacy photo location (pre-relocation). Kept ignored deliberately: a clone
# that pulls the move but hasn't run `mv static/uploads photo_uploads` yet still
# has the old directory on disk, and without this line it shows up untracked —
# one `git add -A` from publishing the family photo library to a PUBLIC repo.
# Safe to keep forever; the app never writes here again.
static/uploads/
trip_data/
users.json
# One of the two private location files (the other is trip_data/family.json,
# already covered by the trip_data/ rule above): home.json is the family's own
# coordinates, family.json is relatives' houses — names plus driveway pins,
# which are street addresses. This repo is PUBLIC, so neither may ever be
# tracked; they travel between hosts via backup.sh / sync-from-pa.sh.
home.json
backup/
*.bak
# Scratch notes only. Scoped to the repo root (a bare `*.txt` also swallowed
# nested ones, so any new .txt under a subdirectory went silently untracked —
# usb/ had to be exempted by hand for exactly that reason).
/*.txt
!/ekko_trips_requirements.txt
!/summer_seeker_requirements.txt

ridb/facilities.json
ridb/rmnp_campgrounds.json
.aider*
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/todos*
.claude/statsig/
.claude/.nfs*
.az_sweep_wip/
.ca_sweep_wip/

# Offline map-tile store (USB stick only; never commit / never reaches PA)
/tiles/
*.mbtiles
*.pmtiles
